Package: repdist
Title: Homology-Aware Beta Diversity from Protein Language Model Embeddings
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yixuan", "Yang", email = "yixuanyang309@icloud.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Sample distances for metaproteomics that treat each sample as an
    abundance-weighted distribution over proteins embedded in a frozen protein
    language model space. Keeps the functional form of weighted UniFrac and
    Bray-Curtis while replacing the ground metric with a PLM metric defined for
    any sequence, including proteins with no tree position and no annotation.
    Returns 'dist' objects for direct use with vegan::adonis2().
